OL,3,ALucy Letby public inquiry findings set
OL,4,Ato be published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry was not tasked with
OL,7,Fexamining Letby's guilt. Instead, it
OL,8,Finvestigated how concerns about the
OL,9,Fneonatal nurse were handled by the
OL,10,Fhospital and whether action could have
OL,11,Fbeen taken sooner to stop her.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
