OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by 3.9%
OL,4,Anext April
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 13 million people receive the
OL,7,Fstate pension in the UK and current
OL,8,Fprojections suggest pensioners will pay
OL,9,Fincome tax on it from 2027 for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
