OL,3,AHarry and Meghan to have security
OL,4,Areview and children change school
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will assess any risks they face in
OL,7,Ftheir new home and the type of trips
OL,8,Ftaken by the couple and their family,
OL,9,Fsuch as regular travel routes and
OL,10,Fschool runs.
OL,12,FIt has also emerged that the Sussexes
OL,13,Fhave changed their children's school,
OL,14,Fonly days after they first started,
OL,15,Fover security concerns about the school
OL,16,Frun.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
