OL,3,AAI getting more powerful 'by the day'
OL,4,Aand kill switch should be required,
OL,5,Atech boss tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FAI is getting more powerful "by the
OL,8,Fday" and a kill switch should be
OL,9,Frequired by firms, one of the
OL,10,Fco-founders of AI company Anthropic
OL,11,Ftells the BBC
OL,13,FJack Clark says AI moves faster than
OL,14,Fother technology - "getting smarter and
OL,15,Fmore capable every few months", which
OL,16,Fcould become a "major risk to society"
OL,18,FIt comes after US President Donald
OL,19,FTrump criticised the head of Anthropic,
OL,20,FDario Amodei, after he called for a
OL,21,Fslowdown in development of the
OL,22,Ftechnology
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
