OL,3,ANato jets down drone that entered
OL,4,ALithuanian airspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FNato fighter pilots have shot down a
OL,7,Fdrone that entered Lithuania's airspace
OL,8,Fovernight, the Lithuanian president
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAuthorities said the drone likely
OL,12,Fentered southern Lithuania, near the
OL,13,Fsecond-largest city of Kaunas, from
OL,14,Fneighbouring Belarus shortly after
OL,15,Fmidnight on Tuesday.
OL,17,FLithuanian President Gitanas NausDWda
OL,18,Fwrote in a statement on X: "A drone
OL,19,Fthat just entered Lithuanian airspace
OL,20,Fwas destroyed by NATO fighter jets."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
